          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A measurable fall in throughput reduces availability of intermediate goods and export volumes for European manufacturers and logistics sectors, causing near‑term output declines and slowing GDP growth momentum." />
