          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained rise in perceived oil‑supply risk forces European institutions into ad hoc debates over emergency gas/oil rationing, strategic stock releases, price caps and fiscal support, increasing the unpredictability and timing of policy decisions." />
