          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained elevation of naval and military posture in the Gulf forces the U.S. and NATO to reassign ships, air assets and strategic lift to the region, directly reducing available units, pre-positioned stocks and deployment tempo for conventional operations related to Ukraine." />
